WEBVTT

00:02:28.387 --> 00:02:30.561
or in some spoiled food somewhere,

00:02:30.585 --> 00:02:34.189
and all of a sudden,
he starts to not feel so good.

00:02:34.213 --> 00:02:36.791
Maybe he ate something bad for lunch.

00:02:36.815 --> 00:02:39.354
And then things get really horrible,

00:02:39.378 --> 00:02:40.975
as his skin rips apart,

00:02:40.999 --> 00:02:44.493
and he sees a virus
coming out from his insides.

00:02:45.505 --> 00:02:49.051
And then it gets horrible
when he bursts open

00:02:49.075 --> 00:02:52.798
and an army of viruses
floods out from his insides.

00:02:54.636 --> 00:02:56.573
"Ouch" is right.

00:02:57.643 --> 00:03:00.167
If you see this, and you're a bacterium,